n\":{\"value\":\"Explore new skills, deepen existing passions, and get lost creativity what you find just might surprise and inspire you.\",\"is_array\":\"0\"},\"online_admission_button\":{\"value\":\"Online Admission\",\"is_array\":\"0\"},\"online_admission_link\":{\"value\":\"#\",\"is_array\":\"0\"}}},\"366g5d3e2e\":{\"styles\":{\"content_width\":\"\",\"width-height-type\":\"px\",\"width\":\"\",\"height\":\"\",\"min-width\":\"\",\"max-width\":\"\",\"min-height\":\"\",\"max-height\":\"\",\"margin-type\":\"px\",\"margin-top\":\"\",\"margin-right\":\"\",\"margin-bottom\":\"\",\"margin-left\":\"\",\"padding-type\":\"px\",\"padding-top\":\"\",\"padding-right\":\"\",\"padding-bottom\":\"\",\"padding-left\":\"\",\"z-index\":\"\",\"classes\":\"\",\"custom_attributes\":\"\",\"background-size\":\"\",\"background-position\":\"\"}},\"366g5d60dc\":{\"settings\":{\"faqs_heading\":{\"value\":\"\",\"is_array\":\"0\"},\"faq_datas\":{\"value\":{\"621698322131\":{\"faq_question\":\"Does SAC developed by TIScation offer a SaaS-based ERP solution?\",\"faq_answer\":\"<p><strong>Yes<\\/strong>, SAC developed by TIScation provides a cutting-edge SaaS-based ERP solution packed with tons of features to simplify educational management. Here\\u2019s a glimpse of what it offers:<\\/p> <br> <ul style=\\\"list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\\\"> <li style=\\\"padding: 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\\\"><strong>1. Multi-School Management:<\\/strong> Manage multiple schools efficiently under a single platform.<\\/li> <br> <li style=\\\"padding: 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\\\"><strong>2. Student and Parent Management:<\\/strong> Enable effective communication and tracking of student activities.<\\/li> <br> <li style=\\\"padding: 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\\\"><strong>3. Accounts Section:<\\/strong> Oversee and manage all financial transactions seamlessly.<\\/li> <br> <li style=\\\"padding: 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\\\"><strong>4. Fees Section:<\\/strong> Streamline fee collection and generate detailed records.<\\/li> <br> <li style=\\\"padding: 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\\\"><strong>5. Examination Section:<\\/strong> Plan, schedule, and track examinations with ease.<\\/li> <br> <li style=\\\"padding: 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\\\"><strong>6. Communication Tools:<\\/strong> Enhance collaboration with integrated communication features.<\\/li> <br> <li style=\\\"padding: 10px;\\\"><strong>7. Reports:<\\/strong> Generate detailed reports for informed decision-making and insights.<\\/li> <\\/ul> <br> <p>In addition to these core modules, SAC developed by TIScation includes **tons of additional features** designed to handle every aspect of school management with ease. This robust solution ensures smooth operations for administrators, educators, and parents, making it the ultimate tool for modern educational institutions.<\\/p>\"},\"1698322142093\":{\"faq_question\":\"Does SAC developed by TIScation offer a support system?\",\"faq_answer\":\"<p><strong>Yes<\\/strong>, SAC developed by TIScation provides a dedicated support system to assist our users. Our best-in-class support team is always ready to resolve your queries and ensure a seamless experience with our platform.<\\/p><br> <p>We take pride in offering prompt, professional, and reliable support to meet the unique needs of educational institutions. Whether it\\u2019s technical assistance, product guidance, or troubleshooting, our team has got you covered.<\\/p><br> <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/ticket.aorasoft.com\\/login\\\" style=\\\"display: inline-block; padding: 10px 15px; background-color: #007bff; color: #fff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px; font-weight: bold;\\\">Visit Support System<\\/a>\"},\"1698322264201\":{\"faq_question\":\"Is there an option to change the frontend design structure?\",\"faq_answer\":\"<span class=\\\" author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zsz78zz72zz122zz85zauz85zz84zz80zz65zz88zqj38z87zz67zez72ziz70zaaxz85